{"version":2,"sourceHash":"8ba562241517e1e324fbb5326f4ec69210a15b0a6dae5c333b57fe04c2e0c36e","locale":"zh-TW","id":"ep-05","no":"EP.05","tag":"第5話 · 與我相同，站在我這邊","title":"與我相同，站在我這邊","beats":[{"s":"n","bg":"islandIn","bgm":"neo","l":{"who":"yeon"},"c":{"who":"neo"},"r":{"who":"mirror"},"t":"鏡之迴廊的空氣沉了下來。剛從亥水深淵出來，好不容易才把濕身子弄乾，眼前鏡中的Yeoni卻緩緩舉起了手。","id":"ep-05:1","scene":{"background":"islandIn","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: islandIn","transition":"crossfade","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"islandIn 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"s":"n","fx":"veil","t":"無數鏡片浮在她身後，每一片都映著不同的Yeoni。","id":"ep-05:2","scene":{"background":"islandIn","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: islandIn","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"veil","camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"islandIn 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"s":"n","t":"生氣的Yeoni，放棄的Yeoni，與別人比較的Yeoni，裝沒事笑著的Yeoni，一臉什麼也做不了的Yeoni。","id":"ep-05:3"},{"s":"n","t":"以及望著這些自己、露出厭倦表情的另一個Yeoni。","id":"ep-05:4"},{"s":"yeon","x":"grin","t":"哇，我發行的版本比想像中多啊。怎麼也不整理一下更新。","id":"ep-05:5"},{"s":"neo","x":"talk","t":"這是比劫之島的最後一場試煉。","id":"ep-05:6"},{"s":"yeon","x":"grin","t":"至少告訴我考試名稱吧。死也讓我有個心理準備。","id":"ep-05:7"},{"s":"n","im":true,"t":"那一瞬間，文字浮在迴廊中央。","id":"ep-05:8","scene":{"background":"islandIn","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: islandIn","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"islandIn 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"s":"sys","im":true,"t":"[ 比劫之島 · 最終試煉 ]\n[ 分辨與你相同的面孔。 ]\n[ 與比肩為伴，斬斷劫財。 ]","id":"ep-05:9","scene":{"background":"islandIn","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: islandIn","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"islandIn 배경에서 진행되는 시스템 메시지"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"s":"yeon","x":"surprise","t":"等等。沒有新手教學，難度怎麼突然變這樣？","id":"ep-05:10"},{"s":"neo","x":"lecture","t":"相同的氣支持你時，呈現比肩的面貌；覬覦你的份額時，呈現劫財的面貌。這裡要你親眼看出區別。","id":"ep-05:11"},{"s":"yeon","x":"think","t":"所以臉都和我一樣，可一個是同伴，一個是想騙走我位置的傢伙，對吧？","id":"ep-05:12"},{"s":"neo","x":"talk","t":"沒錯。可兩者都是你的臉，別被外表騙了。","id":"ep-05:13"},{"s":"yeon","x":"grin","t":"哇，這遊戲真新穎。敵人和隊友用同一個造型。怎麼不加個防誤傷系統。","id":"ep-05:14"},{"s":"n","t":"Yeoni掃視那些鏡片，全是自己的臉，全是自己的表情。喉嚨發乾，到底要靠什麼區分。","id":"ep-05:15"},{"s":"geo","t":"不會那麼容易喔？","id":"ep-05:16"},{"s":"n","fx":"veil","t":"鏡中的Yeoni輕輕打了個響指。啪。","id":"ep-05:17","scene":{"background":"islandIn","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: islandIn","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"veil","camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"islandIn 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"s":"n","bgm":"crisis","t":"最先走出來的是滿臉怒氣的Yeoni。她雙手抱胸，腳尖點著地，瞪著這邊。","id":"ep-05:18","scene":{"background":"islandIn","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: islandIn","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"islandIn 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"s":"n","t":"「你總是忍著，之後才在莫名其妙的地方爆發。」","id":"ep-05:19"},{"s":"yeon","x":"surprise","t":"喂，開場台詞就用大實話打人，犯規了吧。","id":"ep-05:20"},{"s":"n","t":"「不喜歡，當場說不喜歡就好。偏要裝沒事，回家才一個人踢被子。」","id":"ep-05:21"},{"s":"yeon","x":"grin","t":"別說了。我剛在深淵灌了一肚子水出來，心理狀態還濕漉漉的。","id":"ep-05:22"},{"s":"n","t":"「所以，又想用笑話蓋過去？」Yeoni閉上了嘴，反駁卡在喉間。","id":"ep-05:23"},{"s":"n","fx":"ink","t":"趁著這片語塞的空隙，憤怒的Yeoni腳下，黑色鏡片像尖刺般長了出來。","id":"ep-05:24","scene":{"background":"islandIn","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: islandIn","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"ink","camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"islandIn 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"s":"neo","x":"talk","t":"小心，現在她想連你的份也拿走。","id":"ep-05:25"},{"s":"yeon","x":"think","t":"她不是我這邊的嗎？剛才說的都是對的啊。","id":"ep-05:26"},{"s":"neo","x":"lecture","t":"用正確的話逼迫你，想代替你佔據你的位置，那就是劫財。","id":"ep-05:27"},{"s":"n","fx":"claw","t":"憤怒的Yeoni笑得尖銳。「所以我替你說吧，反正你也做不到。」","id":"ep-05:28","scene":{"background":"islandIn","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: islandIn","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"claw","camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"islandIn 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"s":"n","t":"紅色玻璃碎片從她指尖像箭一樣飛來，Yeongnyangi躍起擋在前面。鏘！","id":"ep-05:29"},{"s":"neo","x":"serious","t":"Yeoni，清醒一點！","id":"ep-05:30"},{"s":"yeon","x":"surprise","t":"知道了，我知道了！","id":"ep-05:31"},{"s":"n","t":"Yeoni把前蹄穩穩踩在地上。[乙]的暖意從胸中升起，腳下冒出綠藤。","id":"ep-05:32"},{"s":"n","t":"憤怒的Yeoni卻沒有停。「你總是晚。發火晚，開口晚，連決定都慢一拍。」","id":"ep-05:33"},{"s":"n","bg":"islandIn","tone":"desat","t":"Yeoni咬緊牙。正因為說得沒錯，才更疼，心口灼熱地繃緊。","id":"ep-05:34","scene":{"background":"islandIn","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: islandIn","transition":"hold","tone":"desat","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"islandIn 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"s":"n","bg":"islandIn","t":"可唯獨這次，不想轉身逃跑。","id":"ep-05:35","scene":{"background":"islandIn","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: islandIn","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"islandIn 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"s":"yeon","x":"calm","t":"……沒錯，我經常事後才爆發，不否認。","id":"ep-05:36"},{"s":"n","t":"憤怒的Yeoni眼神一晃，像是沒料到會聽見這個回答。","id":"ep-05:37"},{"s":"yeon","x":"talk","t":"可我不想讓你代替我爆發。","id":"ep-05:38"},{"s":"n","t":"「……為什麼。」","id":"ep-05:39"},{"s":"yeon","x":"talk","t":"那又不是我說的話。聲音是出來了，可我自己不在裡面啊。","id":"ep-05:40"},{"s":"n","t":"Yeoni迎著紅色碎片飛來的方向，向前踏了一步。","id":"ep-05:41"},{"s":"yeon","im":true,"x":"talk","t":"生氣不是壞事。但奪走我的嘴，替我大喊，那可不是站在我這邊。","id":"ep-05:42","scene":{"background":"islandIn","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: islandIn","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"islandIn 배경에서 진행되는 yeon의 대사"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"s":"n","t":"紅色玻璃碎片在空中搖晃，失去速度。","id":"ep-05:43"},{"s":"yeon","x":"gentle","t":"你可以成為我的同伴。但讓我消失的方式，恕不接受。","id":"ep-05:44"},{"s":"n","t":"憤怒的Yeoni神情僵住，腳下黑色碎片悄然融化消失。紅光像收起尖刺般柔和下來。","id":"ep-05:45"},{"s":"n","t":"「那……就別光忍著。」憤怒的Yeoni輕聲低語。","id":"ep-05:46"},{"s":"yeon","x":"soft","t":"嗯。下次我會當場說，免得回家踢被子。我會練習。","id":"ep-05:47"},{"s":"n","fx":"veil","t":"憤怒的Yeoni散成紅光，化為一塊小小的紅鏡片，靜靜貼在Yeoni身旁。","id":"ep-05:48","scene":{"background":"islandIn","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: islandIn","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"veil","camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"islandIn 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"s":"neo","x":"soft","t":"轉為比肩了，你多了一個同伴。","id":"ep-05:49"},{"s":"yeon","x":"excited","t":"喔，我剛抓到第一隻寶可夢？感覺像扔了個精靈球。","id":"ep-05:50"},{"s":"n","t":"興奮地揮動前蹄時，扁鼻孔自己噴出一口氣。哼唧。一縷白霧在迴廊凝起，又散開。","id":"ep-05:51"},{"s":"neo","x":"deadpan","t":"……別這樣理解。","id":"ep-05:52"},{"s":"neo","x":"deadpan","t":"不是寶可夢。它們不會逃跑，也不會進化。","id":"ep-05:53"},{"s":"yeon","x":"grin","t":"可這樣理解，我突然覺得能行了啊。","id":"ep-05:54"},{"s":"n","bg":"islandIn","bgm":"gloom","tone":"desat","t":"接著出現的是一臉放棄的Yeoni。不，她沒有走過來，只坐在地上抬起頭，眼神空空的。","id":"ep-05:55","scene":{"background":"islandIn","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: islandIn","transition":"hold","tone":"desat","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"islandIn 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"s":"n","t":"「不做也沒關係，反正又會失敗。」","id":"ep-05:56"},{"s":"n","t":"Yeoni的心沉了一截。那聲音太熟悉了。還沒開始就已疲憊的心，害怕期待之後更痛，先把希望收起的那些夜晚。","id":"ep-05:57"},{"s":"n","t":"「你也知道，期待多少，就會累多少。」","id":"ep-05:58"},{"s":"yeon","x":"calm","t":"……嗯，知道。深有體會。","id":"ep-05:59"},{"s":"n","fx":"ink","t":"「所以，放下就好。」灰色鏡片在她周圍緩緩浮起，每一片都映著Yeoni放棄的瞬間。","id":"ep-05:60","scene":{"background":"islandIn","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: islandIn","transition":"hold","tone":"desat","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"ink","camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"islandIn 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"s":"n","t":"在提交按鈕前關掉的申請表，寫好又刪掉的訊息，凌晨裝作無所謂、把螢幕倒扣的指尖。","id":"ep-05:61"},{"s":"n","t":"「沒有期待，就沒有失望。」這話奇異地甜，像承諾不再讓人受傷。Yeoni的腳尖有一瞬往後退。","id":"ep-05:62"},{"s":"n","bg":"islandIn","t":"這時，頭頂花朵下藍色水紋流轉。是[亥]的氣息。深水，沉下去也終究不會消失的心。","id":"ep-05:63","scene":{"background":"islandIn","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: islandIn","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"islandIn 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"s":"yeon","x":"calm","t":"可是我……為了不失望提前放棄，真的有過好多次。","id":"ep-05:64"},{"s":"n","t":"放棄的Yeoni緩緩抬頭。","id":"ep-05:65"},{"s":"yeon","x":"calm","t":"那時確實輕鬆了，只在那一瞬間。","id":"ep-05:66"},{"s":"n","t":"灰色鏡片如水波搖動。","id":"ep-05:67"},{"s":"yeon","x":"talk","t":"試過之後搞砸，難過幾天就過去了。沒試就算了的事，卻跟著我好幾年，晚上只要躺下就會想起來。","id":"ep-05:68"},{"s":"n","t":"放棄的Yeoni表情扭曲。「……可是還是害怕啊。」","id":"ep-05:69"},{"s":"yeon","x":"calm","t":"嗯，現在也怕，前蹄都在抖。","id":"ep-05:70"},{"s":"yeon","x":"talk","t":"但我不願意你因為害怕，就替我把選擇收起來。真要放下，也要由我親手來。","id":"ep-05:71"},{"s":"n","t":"灰色鏡片一片片失去力量，落了下來。「那……真的很累時怎麼辦？」","id":"ep-05:72"},{"s":"yeon","x":"soft","t":"那就休息。","id":"ep-05:73"},{"s":"n","t":"「……不是放棄？」","id":"ep-05:74"},{"s":"yeon","x":"gentle","t":"嗯。休息和放棄，我們從現在開始，分清楚吧。","id":"ep-05:75"},{"s":"n","fx":"veil","t":"放棄的Yeoni默默望了許久，然後很慢很慢地點頭。灰光變成銀光，一塊小銀片飛來，停在Yeoni身旁。","id":"ep-05:76","scene":{"background":"islandIn","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: islandIn","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"veil","camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"islandIn 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"s":"neo","x":"calm","t":"第二個比肩。","id":"ep-05:77"},{"s":"yeon","x":"grin","t":"第二個……這是集滿十個就有贈品的集章卡嗎？","id":"ep-05:78"},{"s":"yeon","x":"grin","t":"這真是考試？我現在感覺像在做付費心理諮商。","id":"ep-05:79"},{"s":"neo","x":"talk","t":"比劫之島，是整理你內在同類之氣的地方。","id":"ep-05:80"},{"s":"yeon","x":"grin","t":"那把服務名稱改溫和點。剛才簡直是心理健身房私人教練課，我連會費都沒交。","id":"ep-05:81"},{"s":"neo","x":"deadpan","t":"不用會費。但也不能中途離開。","id":"ep-05:82"},{"s":"n","bgm":"crisis","t":"這時，鏡中的Yeoni拍手。啪，啪，啪。緩慢的三下。","id":"ep-05:83","scene":{"background":"islandIn","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: islandIn","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"islandIn 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"s":"geo","t":"真感人，差點落淚了。","id":"ep-05:84"},{"s":"geo","t":"不過，你真以為他們全都能成為你的同伴？","id":"ep-05:85"},{"s":"n","fx":"ink","t":"這次，數十塊鏡片一起湧到前方。比較的Yeoni，嫉妒的Yeoni，勉強笑的Yeoni，貶低自己的Yeoni。","id":"ep-05:86","scene":{"background":"islandIn","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: islandIn","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"ink","camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"islandIn 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"s":"n","t":"「她做得那麼好，你為什麼不行？」「裝沒事，別破壞氣氛。」「你本來就沒運氣。」「別期待。」「隨便出頭，只會更丟人。」","id":"ep-05:87"},{"s":"n","t":"聲音同時從四面傾瀉。Yeoni想摀住耳朵，可前蹄圓鈍，聲音全從縫裡鑽進來。","id":"ep-05:88"},{"s":"yeon","x":"surprise","t":"啊，夠了！這根本是凌晨三點的群聊通知啊！","id":"ep-05:89"},{"s":"yeon","x":"surprise","t":"不能靜音，也沒有退出按鈕，這完全是強制參與！","id":"ep-05:90"},{"s":"geo","t":"當然，因為全都是你。","id":"ep-05:91"},{"s":"n","bg":"islandIn","fx":"ink","tone":"dark","t":"聲音越漲越大。「比較。」「藏起來。」「放棄。」「笑著帶過。」「你的位置，從一開始就不存在。」","id":"ep-05:92","scene":{"background":"islandIn","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: islandIn","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"ink","camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"islandIn 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"s":"n","t":"Yeoni頭頂的花搖搖欲墜，[乙]的綠光變淡，連[亥]的水波也泛起黑色。","id":"ep-05:93"},{"s":"n","fx":"claw","t":"Yeongnyangi擋在前面斬開碎片。鏘，鏘，鏘。可碎片增加得比斬除的速度更快。","id":"ep-05:94","scene":{"background":"islandIn","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: islandIn","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"claw","camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"islandIn 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"s":"neo","x":"serious","t":"Yeoni，別一個一個應付！會被埋住的！","id":"ep-05:95"},{"s":"yeon","x":"surprise","t":"那要怎麼辦！全都是我的臉，我根本不知道從哪下手！","id":"ep-05:96"},{"s":"neo","x":"serious","t":"定個標準！","id":"ep-05:97"},{"s":"yeon","x":"surprise","t":"標準？什麼標準！","id":"ep-05:98"},{"s":"neo","x":"serious","t":"守護你的聲音，與奪走你的聲音。就憑這一點區分！","id":"ep-05:99"},{"s":"n","bg":"islandIn","t":"Yeoni屏息。守護與奪走的聲音。這兩個詞在腦中像鎖扣般咬合。","id":"ep-05:100","scene":{"background":"islandIn","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: islandIn","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"islandIn 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"s":"n","t":"那一刻，看似相同的鏡片，開始顯出些微不同。","id":"ep-05:101"},{"s":"n","t":"憤怒的Yeoni，其實在喊：說出來吧。放棄的Yeoni，其實在低語：休息一下也可以。","id":"ep-05:102"},{"s":"n","bg":"islandIn","tone":"dark","t":"可比較的Yeoni，不斷把Yeoni剪得更小。勉強笑的Yeoni，把Yeoni從原地抹去。自貶的Yeoni，悄悄騰空了Yeoni的椅子。","id":"ep-05:103","scene":{"background":"islandIn","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: islandIn","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"islandIn 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"s":"n","t":"Yeoni用力把前蹄踩在地上。","id":"ep-05:104"},{"s":"yeon","x":"talk","t":"好，開始整理。","id":"ep-05:105"},{"s":"n","bg":"islandIn","t":"頭頂的花再次亮起綠光。","id":"ep-05:106","scene":{"background":"islandIn","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: islandIn","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"islandIn 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"s":"yeon","x":"talk","t":"你們之中，想保護我的，到這邊來。","id":"ep-05:107"},{"s":"n","t":"綠藤在Yeoni右側開出一條路。紅鏡片與銀鏡片並排停在路邊。","id":"ep-05:108"},{"s":"yeon","x":"talk","t":"至於總在消磨我的那些。","id":"ep-05:109"},{"s":"n","t":"Yeoni正面望向鏡中的Yeoni。","id":"ep-05:110"},{"s":"yeon","x":"talk","t":"留在那裡，別動。","id":"ep-05:111"},{"s":"geo","t":"喔？你覺得自己分得清？","id":"ep-05:112"},{"s":"yeon","x":"grin","t":"剛剛大概摸到點門道。不過正確率不保證。","id":"ep-05:113"},{"s":"geo","t":"錯了呢？","id":"ep-05:114"},{"s":"yeon","x":"grin","t":"錯了就再學唄。我本來就是重修專業戶。","id":"ep-05:115"},{"s":"yeon","im":true,"x":"talk","t":"我不是每次都能選得完美的人。可現在，我不會再隨便把任何聲音都當成自己的聲音。","id":"ep-05:116","scene":{"background":"islandIn","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: islandIn","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"islandIn 배경에서 진행되는 yeon의 대사"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"s":"n","bgm":"crisis2","fx":"veil","t":"隨著這句話，[乙亥]之光浮在Yeoni面前。綠芽在深水上紮根。水雖暗卻清澈，芽雖小卻堅韌。","id":"ep-05:117","scene":{"background":"islandIn","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: islandIn","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"veil","camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"islandIn 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"s":"n","t":"Yeoni朝那道光伸出前蹄。","id":"ep-05:118"},{"s":"geo","t":"不行！","id":"ep-05:119"},{"s":"n","bg":"islandIn","fx":"hands","tone":"dark","t":"鏡中的Yeoni揮手，比較、勉強笑、自貶的Yeoni的鏡片聚成一團。一隻黑玻璃巨手誕生了，試圖將[乙亥]整個攥住。","id":"ep-05:120","scene":{"background":"islandIn","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: islandIn","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"hands","camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"islandIn 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"s":"neo","x":"serious","t":"Yeoni。","id":"ep-05:121"},{"s":"yeon","x":"surprise","t":"知道，我看到了！","id":"ep-05:122"},{"s":"yeon","x":"surprise","t":"小芽，撐住！只要三秒！","id":"ep-05:123"},{"s":"neo","x":"deadpan","t":"……你真打算把名字定成這個？","id":"ep-05:124"},{"s":"yeon","x":"surprise","t":"取名以後再說，現在很急啊！","id":"ep-05:125"},{"s":"n","bg":"islandIn","fx":"burst","t":"綠藤如爆炸般伸展，將黑玻璃手纏了一圈又一圈。可手太大了，藤蔓被繃得筆直，嘎吱作響，彷彿就要斷開。","id":"ep-05:126","scene":{"background":"islandIn","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: islandIn","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"burst","camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"islandIn 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"s":"n","t":"Yeoni被推得向後滑，前蹄刮過地面。","id":"ep-05:127"},{"s":"yeon","x":"surprise","t":"哇啊，力氣差距真的假的！做個平衡更新吧！","id":"ep-05:128"},{"s":"geo","t":"看吧，到頭來你還是弱，一直都這樣。","id":"ep-05:129"},{"s":"yeon","x":"talk","t":"弱和輸，是完全不同的兩回事好嗎？","id":"ep-05:130"},{"s":"n","t":"這時，[亥]的水動了。深水流入藤蔓根部，從下方托住根。藤蔓變粗，綠光滲入藍色。","id":"ep-05:131"},{"s":"neo","im":true,"x":"serious","t":"乙亥連上了！就是現在，Yeoni！","id":"ep-05:132","scene":{"background":"islandIn","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: islandIn","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"islandIn 배경에서 진행되는 neo의 대사"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"s":"n","t":"Yeoni將伸出的前蹄狠狠落下。","id":"ep-05:133"},{"s":"yeon","x":"talk","t":"從我的位置上，滾出去！","id":"ep-05:134"},{"s":"n","fx":"claw","t":"藤蔓勒緊黑玻璃手。鏘。手背裂開細紋。鏡中的Yeoni第一次臉色僵硬。","id":"ep-05:135","scene":{"background":"islandIn","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: islandIn","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"claw","camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"islandIn 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"s":"yeon","x":"talk","t":"我會動搖，沒錯！我承認！","id":"ep-05:136"},{"s":"n","t":"鏘。裂紋如蛛網蔓延。","id":"ep-05:137"},{"s":"yeon","im":true,"x":"talk","t":"可我會動搖，不代表你就能代替我活啊！","id":"ep-05:138","scene":{"background":"islandIn","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: islandIn","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"islandIn 배경에서 진행되는 yeon의 대사"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"s":"n","fx":"burst","t":"嘩啦！黑玻璃手碎成無數片。比較、勉強笑、自貶的Yeoni的鏡子一同破碎，碎片化作黑塵散去。","id":"ep-05:139","scene":{"background":"islandIn","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: islandIn","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"burst","camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"islandIn 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"s":"n","t":"只剩下幾塊。憤怒Yeoni的紅片，說可以休息的銀片，還有剛剛誕生的小藍片。","id":"ep-05:140"},{"s":"neo","x":"soft","t":"……做得好，真心的。","id":"ep-05:141"},{"s":"yeon","x":"grin","t":"我剛才真的做得很好，對吧？再確認一下給我聽。","id":"ep-05:142"},{"s":"neo","x":"smile","t":"嗯，做得很好。","id":"ep-05:143"},{"s":"yeon","x":"happy","t":"好，這一刻存個檔。這種高光，我人生裡不常有。","id":"ep-05:144"},{"s":"n","t":"感動得高舉前蹄的瞬間，短後腿失去平衡，噗地向旁邊栽倒。帥氣只維持了三句話，到此為止。","id":"ep-05:145"},{"s":"n","t":"Yeongnyangi默默搖頭。就在這時，迴廊中央再次浮現文字。","id":"ep-05:146"},{"s":"sys","t":"[ 比肩分類完成 ]\n[ 劫財淨化進行中 ]\n[ 乙亥日柱回收率87% ]","id":"ep-05:147"},{"s":"yeon","x":"surprise","t":"等等，為什麼不是100%？我剛才不是通關了嗎！","id":"ep-05:148"},{"s":"n","bg":"islandIn","tone":"dark","t":"鏡中的Yeoni慢慢笑了。她還沒有消失，若無其事地站在碎鏡之上，俯視著Yeoni。","id":"ep-05:149","scene":{"background":"islandIn","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: islandIn","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"islandIn 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"s":"geo","t":"當然了。","id":"ep-05:150"},{"s":"geo","im":true,"t":"因為最後的劫財，就是我。","id":"ep-05:151","scene":{"background":"islandIn","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: islandIn","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"islandIn 배경에서 진행되는 geo의 대사"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"s":"n","fx":"ink","t":"Yeoni背脊一涼。鏡中的Yeoni身後，黑色鏡翼徹底展開，每一片羽毛都映著面孔。","id":"ep-05:152","scene":{"background":"islandIn","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: islandIn","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"ink","camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"islandIn 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"s":"n","t":"Yeoni羨慕過的臉，暗暗比較過的人，想成為的樣子，以及世界上最討厭的、自己的那些面孔。","id":"ep-05:153"},{"s":"geo","t":"你要贏我，並不是打碎我。","id":"ep-05:154"},{"s":"n","t":"她用指尖指著自己胸口正中。","id":"ep-05:155"},{"s":"geo","im":true,"t":"你得把我帶回你心裡。","id":"ep-05:156","scene":{"background":"islandIn","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: islandIn","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"islandIn 배경에서 진행되는 geo의 대사"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"s":"yeon","x":"surprise","t":"……什麼？那是什麼意思。","id":"ep-05:157"},{"s":"geo","t":"因為我是被你丟掉的你。打碎我，你的一部分也會一起消失。","id":"ep-05:158"},{"s":"n","t":"Yeoni想找話反駁，最終卻沒找到。看向旁邊，Yeongnyangi的表情也僵住了。","id":"ep-05:159"},{"s":"neo","x":"talk","t":"Yeoni。","id":"ep-05:160"},{"s":"yeon","x":"calm","t":"……嗯。","id":"ep-05:161"},{"s":"neo","x":"serious","t":"這才是真正的最後一場試煉。","id":"ep-05:162"},{"s":"n","t":"Yeoni望著鏡中的自己。人的臉，彷彿毫無破綻的表情，以及蜷縮在那笑容裡的奪取之力。劫財。","id":"ep-05:163"},{"s":"yeon","bg":"islandIn","x":"think","t":"好，總結一下……這局就是最終頭目戰。","id":"ep-05:164","scene":{"background":"islandIn","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: islandIn","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"steady"},"a11y":{"description":"islandIn 배경에서 진행되는 yeon의 대사"}},{"s":"geo","t":"沒錯，現在才發現啊。","id":"ep-05:165"},{"s":"n","t":"整座島再次劇烈搖晃。最後一行文字浮在迴廊上方。","id":"ep-05:166"},{"s":"sys","im":true,"t":"[ 最終劫財戰 ]\n[ 找回鏡中的自己。 ]","id":"ep-05:167","scene":{"background":"islandIn","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: islandIn","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"islandIn 배경에서 진행되는 시스템 메시지"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"s":"yeon","x":"talk","t":"找回，說得真輕巧。","id":"ep-05:168"},{"s":"neo","x":"talk","t":"你一逃，她就會把你的位置整個奪走。","id":"ep-05:169"},{"s":"yeon","x":"think","t":"那直接打碎呢？","id":"ep-05:170"},{"s":"neo","x":"talk","t":"如果只打碎，你也會失去自己的一部分。","id":"ep-05:171"},{"s":"yeon","x":"talk","t":"那到底什麼才是正確答案？給點提示。","id":"ep-05:172"},{"s":"neo","x":"calm","t":"……讓她成為你的一部分。別推開，去擁抱。","id":"ep-05:173"},{"s":"n","t":"Yeoni久久望著鏡中的自己。鏡中的Yeoni同樣回望。一個人，一個花豬。臉完全不同，眼神卻比最初更相似了些。","id":"ep-05:174"},{"s":"yeon","x":"soft","t":"我這個人，活得還真夠費勁。","id":"ep-05:175"},{"s":"geo","t":"……就是說啊。","id":"ep-05:176"},{"s":"n","t":"這次的回答沒有嘲笑。極短的一瞬，真的只是一眨眼。像同一個人，分擔著同一份疲憊的表情。","id":"ep-05:177"},{"s":"n","bg":"islandIn","fx":"burst","tone":"dark","t":"下一刻，鏡中的Yeoni張開黑翼，朝Yeoni撲來。","id":"ep-05:178","scene":{"background":"islandIn","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: islandIn","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"burst","camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"islandIn 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"s":"sys","im":true,"t":"[ 比劫之島最終戰開始 ]","id":"ep-05:179","scene":{"background":"islandIn","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: islandIn","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"islandIn 배경에서 진행되는 시스템 메시지"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}}]}
